          <h2 class="font-semibold text-ink text-base mb-3">6. Data Transfers</h2>
          <p>Your personal data will not be sold, rented or shared for commercial purposes with third parties, except where required by law, court order or a competent authority's request. International data transfers are only carried out with appropriate safeguards under Chapter V of the GDPR.</p>
