        <section>
          <h2 class="font-semibold text-ink text-base mb-3">8. Your Rights under GDPR</h2>
          <p class="mb-4">If you reside in the European Union or European Economic Area, you have the following rights under GDPR Articles 15–22:</p>
          <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
            <div class="bg-white border border-warm-tertiary rounded-xl p-4">
              <p class="font-medium text-ink text-sm mb-1">Right of Access (Art. 15)</p>
              <p class="text-xs">You may request a copy of the data we hold about you.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white border border-warm-tertiary rounded-xl p-4">
              <p class="font-medium text-ink text-sm mb-1">Right to Rectification (Art. 16)</p>
              <p class="text-xs">You may request correction of inaccurate or incomplete data.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white border border-warm-tertiary rounded-xl p-4">
              <p class="font-medium text-ink text-sm mb-1">Right to Erasure (Art. 17)</p>
              <p class="text-xs">You may request deletion of your data under certain conditions.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white border border-warm-tertiary rounded-xl p-4">
              <p class="font-medium text-ink text-sm mb-1">Right to Portability (Art. 20)</p>
              <p class="text-xs">You may receive your data in a structured, machine-readable format.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white border border-warm-tertiary rounded-xl p-4">
              <p class="font-medium text-ink text-sm mb-1">Right to Object (Art. 21)</p>
              <p class="text-xs">You may object to processing based on legitimate interest or for marketing purposes.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white border border-warm-tertiary rounded-xl p-4">
              <p class="font-medium text-ink text-sm mb-1">Right to Withdraw Consent</p>
              <p class="text-xs">You may withdraw consent for any processing based on your consent at any time.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-4">To exercise your rights, email us at <a href="mailto:info@magusapsikoloji.com" class="text-primary hover:underline">info@magusapsikoloji.com</a>. Requests will be answered within 30 days.</p>
        </section>

        <!-- 9 -->
        <section>
          <h2 class="font-semibold text-ink text-base mb-3">9. Right to Lodge a Complaint</h2>
          <p>If you believe your rights under GDPR have been infringed, you may lodge a complaint with the national Data Protection Authority (DPA) in your country of residence. For a list of EU DPAs, visit: <a href="https://edpb.europa.eu/about-edpb/about-edpb/members_en" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary hover:underline">edpb.europa.eu</a></p>
        </section>

